{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useLocation"},{"type":"text","value":" method is a hook that returns the current "},{"type":"link","href":"./ParsedLocationType.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"location"}]},{"type":"text","value":" object. This hook is useful for when you want to perform some side effect whenever the current location changes."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"uselocation-options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"useLocation options"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useLocation"},{"type":"text","value":" hook accepts an optional "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"options"},{"type":"text","value":" object."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"opts-select-option","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"opts.select"},{"type":"text","value":" option"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"(state: ParsedLocationType) => TSelected"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If supplied, this function will be called with the "},{"type":"link","href":"./ParsedLocationType.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"location"}]},{"type":"text","value":" object and the return value will be returned from "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useLocation"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"uselocation-returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"useLocation returns"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The current "},{"type":"link","href":"./ParsedLocationType.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"location"}]},{"type":"text","value":" object or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TSelected"},{"type":"text","value":" if a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"select"},{"type":"text","value":" function is provided."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"examples","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Examples"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { useLocation } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nfunction Component() {\n  const location = useLocation()\n  //    ^ ParsedLocation\n\n  // OR\n\n  const pathname = useLocation({\n    select: (location) => location.pathname,\n  })\n  //    ^ string\n\n  // ...\n}","lang":"tsx"}],"headings":[{"id":"uselocation-options","text":"useLocation options","level":2},{"id":"opts-select-option","text":"opts.select option","level":3},{"id":"uselocation-returns","text":"useLocation returns","level":2},{"id":"examples","text":"Examples","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThe `useLocation` method is a hook that returns the current [`location`](./ParsedLocationType.md) object. This hook is useful for when you want to perform some side effect whenever the current location changes.\n\n## useLocation options\n\nThe `useLocation` hook accepts an optional `options` object.\n\n### `opts.select` option\n\n- Type: `(state: ParsedLocationType) => TSelected`\n- Optional\n- If supplied, this function will be called with the [`location`](./ParsedLocationType.md) object and the return value will be returned from `useLocation`.\n\n## useLocation returns\n\n- The current [`location`](./ParsedLocationType.md) object or `TSelected` if a `select` function is provided.\n\n## Examples\n\n```tsx\nimport { useLocation } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nfunction Component() {\n  const location = useLocation()\n  //    ^ ParsedLocation\n\n  // OR\n\n  const pathname = useLocation({\n    select: (location) => location.pathname,\n  })\n  //    ^ string\n\n  // ...\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: useLocationHook\ntitle: useLocation hook\n---\n\nThe `useLocation` method is a hook that returns the current [`location`](./ParsedLocationType.md) object. This hook is useful for when you want to perform some side effect whenever the current location changes.\n\n## useLocation options\n\nThe `useLocation` hook accepts an optional `options` object.\n\n### `opts.select` option\n\n- Type: `(state: ParsedLocationType) => TSelected`\n- Optional\n- If supplied, this function will be called with the [`location`](./ParsedLocationType.md) object and the return value will be returned from `useLocation`.\n\n## useLocation returns\n\n- The current [`location`](./ParsedLocationType.md) object or `TSelected` if a `select` function is provided.\n\n## Examples\n\n```tsx\nimport { useLocation } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nfunction Component() {\n  const location = useLocation()\n  //    ^ ParsedLocation\n\n  // OR\n\n  const pathname = useLocation({\n    select: (location) => location.pathname,\n  })\n  //    ^ string\n\n  // ...\n}\n```\n"}
